<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN SERIE C PLAYER BANNED FOR DOPING.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN SERIE C PLAYER BANNED FOR DOPING.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian third division soccer player Cristian Biancone of Lodigiani was banned until October on Saturday for a doping offence.</p>
<p>Biancone tested positive for a cocaine-based substance in a dope test on March 29 after a match against Acireale.</p>
<p>The serie C disciplinary commission said they had suspended him until October 24.</p>
